{"2936430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "House Fighters: Total Mess", "steam_appid": 2936430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.poster.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.webm?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.mp4?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House Fighters: Total Mess is a playful arcade dogfighting game. Hop into a toy plane, zip through cozy rooms, and turn everyday objects into thrilling battlegrounds. No complicated controls, just pure, lighthearted aerial chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/e93c2bb74130f6d15c7281c189adfb52.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.poster.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.webm?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.mp4?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and strike in high-speed dogfights. Use rockets, bombs, and even household items to outmaneuver your toy-sized foes. Complete rescue missions to save your friends from threats in the toy room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/df7b1327d9b67d10a7ca6fed15fdc491.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.poster.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.webm?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.mp4?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighter with playful stickers, paint jobs, and multiple color options. Experiment to find the perfect look for every mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/9fd1a4ca95e3ff0e9b797572f47acdfe.avif?t=1762775829\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras_big/9fd1a4ca95e3ff0e9b797572f47acdfe.avif?t=1762775829 width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.poster.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.webm?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.mp4?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase, dodge, and loop through playful missions where every room holds a new challenge. Sneak past towering obstacles, weave through tight spaces, and take on clever little foes in fast, lighthearted dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day spaces become toy-sized dogfight battle arenas, spanning across the bedroom, kitchen, garage, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of your environment, collecting explosives and everyday items to fire away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven missions, where you can lend a helping hand to a whimsical cast of toys in need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aircraft stats system, featuring 5 total different types of aircraft, each featuring its own advantages and disadvantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickers, paint jobs and multiple color options to customize the jet with your own sense of style.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.poster.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.webm?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/8455ffd669a1cd40be540810bb7834ea.mp4?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >House Fighters: Total Mess is a playful arcade dogfighting game. Hop into a toy plane, zip through cozy rooms, and turn everyday objects into thrilling battlegrounds. No complicated controls, just pure, lighthearted aerial chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/e93c2bb74130f6d15c7281c189adfb52.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.poster.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.webm?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/a67ed363b6dcf42cdd48553b47729960.mp4?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and strike in high-speed dogfights. Use rockets, bombs, and even household items to outmaneuver your toy-sized foes. Complete rescue missions to save your friends from threats in the toy room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/df7b1327d9b67d10a7ca6fed15fdc491.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.poster.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.webm?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/dbeaf43eb5012920521ff3e28afed73d.mp4?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fighter with playful stickers, paint jobs, and multiple color options. Experiment to find the perfect look for every mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/9fd1a4ca95e3ff0e9b797572f47acdfe.avif?t=1762775829\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras_big/9fd1a4ca95e3ff0e9b797572f47acdfe.avif?t=1762775829 width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.poster.avif?t=1762775829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.webm?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/extras/72b93f356d493832e8b7b2edc0febded.mp4?t=1762775829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase, dodge, and loop through playful missions where every room holds a new challenge. Sneak past towering obstacles, weave through tight spaces, and take on clever little foes in fast, lighthearted dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day spaces become toy-sized dogfight battle arenas, spanning across the bedroom, kitchen, garage, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of your environment, collecting explosives and everyday items to fire away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven missions, where you can lend a helping hand to a whimsical cast of toys in need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aircraft stats system, featuring 5 total different types of aircraft, each featuring its own advantages and disadvantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickers, paint jobs and multiple color options to customize the jet with your own sense of style.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "House Fighters: Total Mess is a PvE aerial arcade shooter where toy planes battle in everyday spaces. Engage in fast-paced dogfights in this nostalgia-filled world, take on clever foes, and fight to save your fellow toy friends!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/header.jpg?t=1762775829", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936430/bc4c36695a395453292fbc78496e9b01befafed9/capsule_231x87